{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24950","headline":"春云 · 裴澄","name":"春云","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漠漠复溶溶，乘春任所从。\n映林初展叶，触石未成峰。\n旭日消寒翠，晴烟点净容。\n霏微将似灭，深浅又如重。\n薄彩临溪散，轻阴带雨浓。\n空余负樵者，岭上自相逢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴澄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24950.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24950","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}